    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_p_m_stack" kindref="compound">PMStack</ref> - This class implements a stack data structure of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_p_m_data_manager" kindref="compound">PMDataManager</ref> pointers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Top level pass managers (see PassManager.cpp) maintain active <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref> Managers using <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_p_m_stack" kindref="compound">PMStack</ref>. Each <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref> implements assignPassManager() to connect itself with appropriate manager. assignPassManager() walks <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_p_m_stack" kindref="compound">PMStack</ref> to find suitable manager. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
